    cell WC bowl\r\n-Added odometer to Van and work hour meter to Tractor\r\n\r\n04.09.2017\r\n-Fixed
    issue with previous jail data not resetting properly when taking a new game \r\n-Added
    another amis car to race around Per\xE4j\xE4rvi roads\r\n-Made amis cars speeds
