    be fixed now\r\n-Shortened the refueling distance from the pumps\r\n\r\n31.07.2017\r\n-Fixed
    repair shop not being open at Fridays and being open at Sundays\r\n-Fixed issue
    with Block replacement being successful even when the engine was not disassembled\r\n-Made
    a closure for the life story lines of \"kilju guy\"\r\n-Player colliding with
