    bug with cops where some offences were not noted if player stopped for breath
    test\r\n-Changed so that player is released from jail instantly when he has 0
    days left\r\n\r\n20.06.2017\r\n-Added engine spare parts to Fleetari for instant
    purchase\r\n-Fixed issue with some pistons not breaking off properly in case of
    failure\r\n-Fixed issue with timing cover removal \r\n-Fixed issue with radiator
